=== Prompt ===
Who is Mario from Nintendo?

=== Response ===
Mario is a iconic character in the world of video games, created by Shigeru Miyamoto and first introduced in the game "Donkey Kong" in 1981. He has since become one of the most recognizable and beloved video game characters globally.

In the Mario franchise, Mario is typically depicted as a plumber who often rescues Princess Peach (formerly kidnapped by Bowser) from the Mushroom Kingdom. He is known for his red hat, mustache, and ability to jump high. Mario appears in numerous games across various genres, including platformers, action-adventure, racing, sports, and role-playing games.

Beyond his plumber persona, Mario also has a royal lineage, with some games and stories referring to him as the rightful king of the Mushroom Kingdom. His adventures have taken him from the 2D landscapes of classic Nintendo consoles to the 3D environments of modern gaming systems.

Mario's character has evolved over the years, with different depictions in various media, including TV shows, movies, and comic books, always maintaining his core personality traits of bravery, determination, and a sense of humor.

